{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23280","headline":"东楼南望八韵 · 白居易","name":"东楼南望八韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不厌东南望，江楼对海门。\n风涛生有信，天水合无痕。\n鷁带云帆动，鸥和雪浪翻。\n鱼盐聚爲市，烟火起成村。\n日脚金波碎，峰头钿点繁。\n送秋千里雁，报暝一声猿。\n已豁烦襟闷，仍开病眼昏。\n郡中登眺处，无胜此东轩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23280.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23280","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}